From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheShermanTanker <tanksherman27@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Apr 2025 21:06:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Use lowercase Windows header names

From the Windows/gcc port in https://github.com/TheShermanTanker/jdk,
branch experimental, commit 9abbd169, rebased onto jdk-27+35. Only the
lowercase Windows header names are kept; the rest reverted upstream
code that the port does not need.

Upstream: JEP draft 8288293 (https://openjdk.org/jeps/8288293), not merged
